        "gp": 50,
        "personality_traits": "Secretly fears deep water. Laughs quietly whenever danger becomes especially severe. Keeps meticulous records of debts, favors, and insults. Collects expensive perfumes from every city she visits.",
        "ideals": "Comfortable Wealth. Starting wealth is twice normal.",
        "bonds": "Deeply vain about her hair. Mistaken Identity - someone important thinks she is someone else.",
        "flaws": "Impulsiveness. Curious. Greedy. Gregarious.",
        "backstory": "A fire-touched sorceress of noble blood, Farah carries flames in her veins and ambition in her heart. Her past is wrapped in mistaken identity - someone powerful believes she is another. Age 24, 5'8\", 125 lb.\n\n**Skills (GCS detail):** Sex Appeal 10, Research 11, Knife 12, Intimidation 11, Fast-Talk 12, Fast-Draw (Sword) 13, Current Affairs (People) 12, Innate Attack (Beam) 12, Innate Attack (Breath) 12, Climbing 11, Broadsword 13, Axe/Mace 11\n\n**Spells (GCS detail):** Fire College: Breathe Fire 12, Create Fire 12, Extinguish Fire 12, Fireproof 12, Flame Jet 12, Flaming Weapon 13, Heat 12, Ignite Fire 12, Resist Fire 12, Shape Fire 12, Smoke 12\n\n**Equipment (GCS detail):** Shoes, Cloth Padded Arm Armor, Mail Fine Torso Armor, Thrusting Broadsword, 3 pt Powerstone, Dagger Fine, Backpack Small (Personal Basics, Ointment: Attractiveness, Lacquered Journal)",
